    "title": "Tri-Co launches regional expansion across Southern California - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By TileLetter ,\n10 hours ago Tri-Co, a premier commercial flooring contractor serving San Diego for 67 years, is expanding its operations across Orange County, Los Angeles, and the Inland Empire. Industry veteran Phil Bannan has joined as Regional Manager and will work alongside partners Jason Anderson, Mike Baker, and Miguel Burboa to lead growth across these new markets. Read full article",
